  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Welcome, Word Explorer!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "Today is a **check-in**. We will play with letters, sounds, words and a little story. There are no wrong guesses, only tries!"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "emoji": "📚",
      "alt": "A pile of books",
      "caption": "Let us explore words!"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 1: Letters and sounds"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "The **alphabet** has 26 letters. Each letter makes a **sound**. Put the sounds together and you can read a word!"
    },
    {
      "type": "explainer",
      "title": "Sounds make a word",
      "scenes": [
        {
          "caption": "Say the first sound: c.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "c",
              "x": 30,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "c",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "bounce"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "Now the next sound: a.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "c",
              "x": 30,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "c",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "a",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "a",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "bounce"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "And the last sound: t.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "c",
              "x": 30,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "c",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "a",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "a",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "t",
              "x": 70,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "t",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "bounce"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "Push the sounds together: c, a, t says cat!",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "c",
              "x": 38,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "c",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "a",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "a",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "t",
              "x": 62,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "t",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "🐱",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 18,
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "grow",
              "label": "cat"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "question": {
        "type": "multiple_choice",
        "prompt": "Which word starts with the same sound as snake?",
        "emoji": "🐍",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "text": "sun"
          },
          {
            "id": "b",
            "text": "hat"
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "text": "dog"
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          "a"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 2: Rhymes"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "Words that **rhyme** sound the same at the end. Cat and hat rhyme. They both end in the sound at."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "emoji": "🐱🎩",
      "alt": "A cat and a hat",
      "caption": "cat and hat rhyme"
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "question": {
        "type": "match",
        "prompt": "Match the words that rhyme.",
        "ref": "c1",
        "skill_tag": "rhyme.match",
        "left": [
          {
            "id": "l1",
            "text": "cat"
          },
          {
            "id": "l2",
            "text": "bee"
          },
          {
            "id": "l3",
            "text": "sun"
          }
        ],
        "right": [
          {
            "id": "r1",
            "text": "hat"
          },
          {
            "id": "r2",
            "text": "tree"
          },
          {
            "id": "r3",
            "text": "run"
          }
        ],
        "answer": {
          "l1": "r1",
          "l2": "r2",
          "l3": "r3"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 3: Sentences"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "A **sentence** tells us a whole idea. It starts with a **capital letter** and ends with a **full stop**."
    },
    {
      "type": "explainer",
      "title": "Building a sentence",
      "scenes": [
        {
          "caption": "A sentence starts with a capital letter. Here is a capital T.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "The",
              "x": 15,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w1",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "pulse",
              "label": "capital T"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "Add the next word.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "The",
              "x": 15,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w1",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "dog",
              "x": 40,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w2",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "grow"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "Add the action word.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "The",
              "x": 15,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w1",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "dog",
              "x": 40,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w2",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "runs",
              "x": 68,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w3",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "grow"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "A full stop goes at the end. Now it is a sentence!",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "The",
              "x": 15,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w1",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "dog",
              "x": 40,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w2",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "runs",
              "x": 68,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w3",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "🔴",
              "x": 90,
              "y": 62,
              "id": "dot",
              "size": 1,
              "anim": "pulse",
              "label": "full stop"
            },
            {
              "emoji": "🐕",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 18,
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "bounce"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "manipulative",
      "title": "Word bricks",
      "goal": "Think of a sentence, like I like red apples. Move one brick for every word. How many words is your sentence?",
      "emoji": "🧱",
      "count": 8,
      "zones": [
        "Words in my sentence",
        "Spare bricks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "question": {
        "type": "order",
        "prompt": "Put the words in order to make a sentence.",
        "ref": "c2",
        "skill_tag": "sentences.order",
